    <item>
      <title>Developing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards with our customers</title>
      <link>https://www.anthropic.com/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards</link>
      <description>We’re announcing Enterprise Frontier Safeguards (EFS), a solution that combines the privacy of zero data retention with state-of-the-art safeguards for detecting misuse. EFS works by storing data in cloud infrastructure controlled by the customer, not Anthropic.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.anthropic.com/news/enterprise-frontier-safeguards</guid>
